Z||000014||Raydar||11-16-2000||06:18 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mshill:<BR><B>Do you guys know what the 2.8L or 3.4L would sound like with a cat and resonator tips only?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Did that with mine. (IRM stainless "muffler eliminator" system. Hooker resonators.)<BR>The word "obnoxious" comes to mind. I don't mind "loud", but it resonated at about 2500 RPM. Made a <I>hell</I> of a thrum. You couldn't even hear the radio with the window down. Ended up getting a bullet glasspack welded in, just upstream of the Y. <I>Still</I> sets off car alarms in the parking garage at work  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> (Security must <I>love</I> me), but it's waaayyyy better than it was.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar<P>"You want me to do <I>what</I>!? <BR>If I could do <I>that</I> I'd never leave the house!"||||reg||1
